flowchart LR
    accTitle: Paused runs need a human resume and stopped runs cannot restart
    accDescr: A new run starts paused with calls and outputs blocked. A human may resume it after fresh checks pass. An unhealthy running run pauses, and a hard limit or human decision stops it permanently. A human may also stop a paused run.

    Paused["Paused<br/>Calls and outputs blocked"]
    Running["Running<br/>All three axes healthy"]
    Stopped["Stopped<br/>This run cannot restart"]

    Paused -->|Resume| Running
    Running -->|Pause| Paused
    Running -->|Stop| Stopped
